<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-ITALY'S BAFFI WINS SEVENTH STAGE IN PARIS-NICE RACE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ITALY'S BAFFI WINS SEVENTH STAGE IN PARIS-NICE RACE.</headline>
<dateline>ANTIBES, France 1996-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Adriano Baffi won the 160-km seventh stage of the Paris-Nice race from Saint-Andre-des-Alpes on Saturday.</p>
<p>World champion Johan Museeuw of Belgium finished second and Gian-Matteo Fagnini of Italy was third.</p>
<p>Frenchman Laurent Jalabert retained the overall lead.</p>
